## 🔄 Recurrencia — flag_recurrecia_gestion

| Valor | Significado | Encoding BQ |
|-------|-------------|-------------|
| `Primer gestión` | Lead fresco | NFC normal |
| `Regestión` | Lead reciclado | **NFD** (`o`+U+0301) ⚠️ |

> **Query fix**: `NORMALIZE(flag_recurrecia_gestion, NFC) = 'Regestión'` o `STARTS_WITH(..., 'Regest')`

